==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}} {{term|humidite||lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{term|humiditas|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|umidus||lang=la|damp, moist, wet}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|humidities}}

# [[dampness]], especially that of the [[air]].
# the [[amount]] of [[water]] [[vapour]] in the air.

====Derived terms====
* [[absolute humidity]]
* [[relative humidity]]
* [[specific humidity]]

